{
    "title": "ONE: Crazy 8s Style Game",
    "description": "Welcome to ONE: Crazy 8s Style Game, the card game that brings fresh energy to classic Crazy 8s style gameplay. With vibrant graphics, smooth animations, and a variety of game modes, ONE is perfect for family nights, casual hangouts, or parties with friends. If you like Crazy 8s, UNO, these game is perfect for you!\r\n\r\nONE offers more ways to play, making your game more fun and exciting. Here's what's new:\r\n\r\n*Anything Stack: You can stack a +2 card on a previously played +2 card without drawing any extra cards. The effect of the +2 card will then stack for the next player.\r\n*Multiple Cards Stack: If you have multiple cards of the same rank (pip), you can play them together in one turn, giving you more flexibility and strategy.\r\n\r\nThe game rule is simple: match colors or numbers to play your cards and be the first to empty your hand. Use special action cards to change the game's direction or make your opponent's draw more cards. Here's a quick overview of the special cards:\r\n\r\n*Wild Card: Play it on any card to change the current color.\r\n*Wild Draw Four: Changes the color and forces the next player to draw four cards.\r\n*Wild Punch: Reflects +X effects back to the opponent; otherwise, just changes the color.\r\n*Draw Two: Makes the next player draw two cards.\r\n*Skip: Skips the next player's turn.\r\n*Reverse: Reverses the turn order, changing the game's direction.\r\n*Discard All: Discard all cards of the same color in one go.\r\n*Double Discard All: Discard all cards of two specified colors at once.\r\n\r\nWith its fast-paced gameplay, ONE is perfect for players of all ages and skill levels. Whether you're planning a casual game night or a party, ONE brings excitement and energy to any gathering. Get ready to call out \"ONE!\" as you race to victory in this fun and dynamic card game.\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for? Download it today and start playing ONE!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to ONE: Crazy 8s Style Game, the card game that brings fresh energy to classic Crazy 8s style gameplay. With vibrant graphics, smooth animations, and a variety of game modes, ONE is perfect for family nights, casual hangouts, or parties with friends. If you like Crazy 8s, UNO, these game is perfect for you!<br><br>ONE offers more ways to play, making your game more fun and exciting. Here&#39;s what&#39;s new:<br><br>*Anything Stack: You can stack a +2 card on a previously played +2 card without drawing any extra cards. The effect of the +2 card will then stack for the next player.<br>*Multiple Cards Stack: If you have multiple cards of the same rank (pip), you can play them together in one turn, giving you more flexibility and strategy.<br><br>The game rule is simple: match colors or numbers to play your cards and be the first to empty your hand. Use special action cards to change the game&#39;s direction or make your opponent&#39;s draw more cards. Here&#39;s a quick overview of the special cards:<br><br>*Wild Card: Play it on any card to change the current color.<br>*Wild Draw Four: Changes the color and forces the next player to draw four cards.<br>*Wild Punch: Reflects +X effects back to the opponent; otherwise, just changes the color.<br>*Draw Two: Makes the next player draw two cards.<br>*Skip: Skips the next player&#39;s turn.<br>*Reverse: Reverses the turn order, changing the game&#39;s direction.<br>*Discard All: Discard all cards of the same color in one go.<br>*Double Discard All: Discard all cards of two specified colors at once.<br><br>With its fast-paced gameplay, ONE is perfect for players of all ages and skill levels. Whether you&#39;re planning a casual game night or a party, ONE brings excitement and energy to any gathering. Get ready to call out &quot;ONE!&quot; as you race to victory in this fun and dynamic card game.<br><br>So, what are you waiting for? Download it today and start playing ONE!",
